      "id": "claim_ab3ce52f6f2e48db849170d7074cf9b1",
      "statement": "step ca certificate validates that --offline/--token and --attestation-uri/--kms are incompatible, builds a CertificateFlow (offline CA when --offline), acquires a token (via --token, the ACME branch, or the token flow with ACME-provisioner re-routing), creates the sign request, validates the subject per token type, signs, and writes the certificate chain and private key at 0600.",
